      "html": "<div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#2b2622] font-sans text-[#f7f5f0] antialiased\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"page root container\" style=\"font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif\">\n    <style>\n        @import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lucide-static@1.48.0/font/lucide.css');\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap');\n:root { color-scheme: dark; }\n.field:focus { outline:2px solid #f7f5f0; outline-offset:2px; }\n@media(max-width:720px){.desktop-nav{display:none!important}.mobile-menu{display:flex!important}.shell{padding-left:20px!important;padding-right:20px!important}.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr!important;gap:20px!important}.search-fields{grid-template-columns:1fr!important}.job-meta{display:grid!important;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr!important;gap:8px!important}.listing-head{align-items:flex-start!important;flex-direction:column!important}.job-price{font-size:19px!important}.wide-main{max-width:100%!important}.section-title{font-size:22px!important}}\n    </style>\n    <div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#2b2622]\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"page layout shell\">\n        <header class=\"border-b border-[#3f3a36] bg-[#2b2622]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"site header bar\">\n            <div class=\"shell mx-auto flex h-[68px] max-w-[1240px] items-center justify-between px-10\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"header inner layout bar\">\n                <a aria-label=\"DigosJobs home\" class=\"flex items-center gap-3 no-underline text-[#f7f5f0]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"site logo link\" href=\"#\">\n                    <span class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-[4px] border border-[#aea69c] text-[16px] font-semibold tracking-[-1px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"logo monogram badge\">\n                        D\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"text-[17px] font-medium tracking-[-.3px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"logo text wordmark\">\n                        DigosJobs\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"ml-1 h-5 border-l border-[#3f3a36]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"logo divider rule\">\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"text-[13px] text-[#c9c0ad]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-1-4\" data-name=\"logo city tagline\">\n                        Digos City\n                    </span>\n                </a>\n                <nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" class=\"desktop-nav flex items-center gap-8 text-[14px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"main desktop navigation bar\">\n                    <a class=\"text-[#f7f5f0] no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"find jobs nav link\" href=\"#jobs\">\n                        Find jobs\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"text-[#c9c0ad] no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"applications nav link\" href=\"#applications\">\n                        Applications\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"text-[#c9c0ad] no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"for employers nav link\" href=\"#employers\">\n                        For employers\n                    </a>\n                    <span class=\"ml-2 border-l border-[#3f3a36] pl-6 text-[13px] text-[#aea69c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-2-4\" data-name=\"language indicator label\">\n                        English\n                    </span>\n                </nav>\n                <button aria-label=\"Open navigation\" class=\"mobile-menu hidden h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center border border-[#3f3a36] bg-transparent text-[#f7f5f0]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"mobile menu toggle button\">\n                    <i class=\"icon-menu text-[19px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"menu hamburger icon\">\n                    </i>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n        <main class=\"shell mx-auto max-w-[1240px] px-10 pb-16\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\" data-name=\"main content area\">\n            <section class=\"hero-grid grid grid-cols-[1.1fr_.9fr] items-end gap-12 pb-10 pt-12\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"hero section\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-[680px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"hero headline container\">\n                    <h1 class=\"m-0 text-[42px] font-normal leading-[1.12] tracking-[-1.4px] text-[#f7f5f0] md:text-[48px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"hero headline text\">\n                        Find work that fits your day in Digos.\n                    </h1>\n                    <p class=\"mb-0 mt-4 max-w-[560px] text-[16px] leading-7 text-[#c9c0ad]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"hero subtitle text\">\n                        Search local openings by role and barangay. Compare pay, location, and how to get there before you apply.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mb-1 flex items-center gap-3 border-l border-[#3f3a36] pl-5 text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#c9c0ad]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"location meta callout\">\n                    <i class=\"icon-map-pin text-[17px] text-[#f7f5f0]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"map pin icon\">\n                    </i>\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"location text block\">\n                        Local job listings\n                        <br data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"line break separator\"/>\n                        <span class=\"text-[#aea69c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"full location detail text\">\n                            Digos City, Davao del Sur\n                        </span>\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n            <section aria-label=\"Search jobs\" class=\"border-y border-[#3f3a36] py-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"job search section\">\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1fr_260px_164px] gap-3 search-fields\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"search fields grid\">\n                    <label class=\"block text-[12px] font-medium text-[#dad2c1]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"role keyword search label\">\n                        Role or keyword\n                        <span class=\"mt-2 flex h-12 items-center gap-3 border border-[#3f3a36] bg-[#383330] px-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"role keyword input field\">\n                            <i class=\"icon-search text-[17px] text-[#aea69c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"search icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            <input aria-label=\"Role or keyword\" class=\"field w-full border-0 bg-transparent text-[14px] text-[#f7f5f0] outline-none placeholder:text-[#aea69c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"role keyword text input\" placeholder=\"e.g. cashier, driver, barista\"/>\n                        </span>\n                    </label>\n                    <label class=\"block text-[12px] font-medium text-[#dad2c1]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"barangay select label\">\n                        Barangay\n                        <span class=\"mt-2 flex h-12 items-center justify-between border border-[#3f3a36] bg-[#383330] px-3 text-[14px] text-[#c9c0ad]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"barangay select dropdown field\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"barangay placeholder text\">\n                                Select a barangay\n                            </span>\n                            <i class=\"icon-chevron-down text-[16px] text-[#aea69c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"dropdown chevron icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                    </label>\n                    <button class=\"mt-[22px] flex h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-[#f7f5f0] bg-[#f7f5f0] px-5 text-[14px] font-medium text-[#2b2622] hover:opacity-90\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"find jobs search button\">\n                        <i class=\"icon-search text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"search button icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        Find jobs\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n            <section class=\"pt-9\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"jobs section\" id=\"jobs\">\n                <div class=\"listing-head mb-4 flex items-end justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"section header bar\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"section title container\">\n                        <h2 class=\"section-title m-0 text-[25px] font-medium tracking-[-.45px] text-[#f7f5f0]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"section title heading\">\n                            Jobs open in Digos City\n                        </h2>\n                        <p class=\"mb-0 mt-2 text-[14px] text-[#aea69c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"section title subtitle\">\n                            Pay, place, and commute details shown where provided.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <a class=\"mb-1 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[14px] font-medium text-[#dad2c1] no-underline hover:text-[#f7f5f0]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"see all jobs link\" href=\"#all-jobs\">\n                        See all jobs\n                        <i class=\"icon-arrow-up-right text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"see all jobs arrow icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"border-t border-[#3f3a36]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"job listings list\">\n                    <a class=\"grid grid-cols-[minmax(220px,1.25fr)_minmax(180px,.9fr)_minmax(155px,.75fr)_minmax(220px,1fr)_auto] items-center gap-5 border-b border-[#3f3a36] py-5 text-inherit no-underline hover:bg-[#383330]/40\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"job listing row\" href=\"#job-store-manager\">\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"job title column\">\n                            <div class=\"text-[17px] font-medium text-[#f7f5f0]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"job title text\">\n                                Store Manager\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#c9c0ad]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"job employer text\">\n                                Digos Central Mall\n                                <span class=\"ml-1 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[12px] text-[#dad2c1]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"verified employer badge\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-shield-check text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"shield check verification icon\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    Documents reviewed\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"job salary column\">\n                            <div class=\"font-mono text-[14px] text-[#f7f5f0]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"job salary amount\">\n                                ₱15k–₱20k\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] text-[#aea69c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"job salary period detail\">\n                                per month · Full-time\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-1-3\" data-name=\"job location column\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[14px] text-[#dad2c1]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"job zone label\">\n                                <i class=\"icon-map-pin text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"map pin icon\">\n                                </i>\n                                Zone 1\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] text-[#aea69c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"job barangay detail\">\n                                Poblacion\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-1-4\" data-name=\"job commute column\">\n                            <div class=\"text-[13px] text-[#aea69c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"commute label heading\">\n                                Getting there\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#c9c0ad]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"commute description text\">\n                                Walk from Public Market\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <i class=\"icon-arrow-up-right text-[18px] text-[#aea69c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-1-5\" data-name=\"job row navigation arrow icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"grid grid-cols-[minmax(220px,1.25fr)_minmax(180px,.9fr)_minmax(155px,.75fr)_minmax(220px,1fr)_auto] items-center gap-5 border-b border-[#3f3a36] py-5 text-inherit no-underline hover:bg-[#383330]/40\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"job listing row\" href=\"#job-barista\">\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"job title column\">\n                            <div class=\"text-[17px] font-medium text-[#f7f5f0]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"job title text\">\n                                Barista\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#c9c0ad]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"job employer text\">\n                                Kapehan sa Digos\n                                <span class=\"ml-1 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[12px] text-[#dad2c1]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"verified employer badge\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-shield-check text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"shield check verification icon\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    Documents reviewed\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"job salary column\">\n                            <div class=\"font-mono text-[14px] text-[#f7f5f0]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"job salary amount\">\n                                ₱400\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] text-[#aea69c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"job salary period detail\">\n                                per day · Daily gig\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-2-3\" data-name=\"job location column\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[14px] text-[#dad2c1]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"job zone label\">\n                                <i class=\"icon-map-pin text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"map pin icon\">\n                                </i>\n                                Tres de Mayo\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] text-[#aea69c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"job barangay detail\">\n                                Digos City\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-2-4\" data-name=\"job commute column\">\n                            <div class=\"text-[13px] text-[#aea69c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"commute label heading\">\n                                Getting there\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#c9c0ad]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"commute description text\">\n                                1 trike ride from Gaisano\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <i class=\"icon-arrow-up-right text-[18px] text-[#aea69c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-2-5\" data-name=\"job row navigation arrow icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"grid grid-cols-[minmax(220px,1.25fr)_minmax(180px,.9fr)_minmax(155px,.75fr)_minmax(220px,1fr)_auto] items-center gap-5 border-b border-[#3f3a36] py-5 text-inherit no-underline hover:bg-[#383330]/40\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"job listing row\" href=\"#job-customer-service\">\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"job title column\">\n                            <div class=\"text-[17px] font-medium text-[#f7f5f0]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"job title text\">\n                                Customer Service\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#c9c0ad]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"job employer text\">\n                                Local Telco Branch\n                                <span class=\"ml-1 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[12px] text-[#dad2c1]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"verified employer badge\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-shield-check text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"shield check verification icon\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    Documents reviewed\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"job salary column\">\n                            <div class=\"font-mono text-[14px] text-[#f7f5f0]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"job salary amount\">\n                                ₱14k\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] text-[#aea69c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"job salary period detail\">\n                                per month · Full-time\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-3\" data-name=\"job location column\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[14px] text-[#dad2c1]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"job zone label\">\n                                <i class=\"icon-map-pin text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-3-1-1\" data-name=\"map pin icon\">\n                                </i>\n                                Matti Area\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] text-[#aea69c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"job barangay detail\">\n                                Digos City\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-4\" data-name=\"job commute column\">\n                            <div class=\"text-[13px] text-[#aea69c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-4-1\" data-name=\"commute label heading\">\n                                Getting there\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#c9c0ad]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-4-2\" data-name=\"commute description text\">\n                                Near Capitol\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <i class=\"icon-arrow-up-right text-[18px] text-[#aea69c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-3-5\" data-name=\"job row navigation arrow icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"grid grid-cols-[minmax(220px,1.25fr)_minmax(180px,.9fr)_minmax(155px,.75fr)_minmax(220px,1fr)_auto] items-center gap-5 border-b border-[#3f3a36] py-5 text-inherit no-underline hover:bg-[#383330]/40\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4\" data-name=\"job listing row\" href=\"#job-delivery-rider\">\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"job title column\">\n                            <div class=\"text-[17px] font-medium text-[#f7f5f0]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"job title text\">\n                                Delivery Rider\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#c9c0ad]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"job employer text\">\n                                QuickDeliver\n                                <span class=\"ml-1 text-[12px] text-[#aea69c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"unverified employer note\">\n                                    Verification not shown\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-2\" data-name=\"job salary column\">\n                            <div class=\"font-mono text-[14px] text-[#f7f5f0]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"job salary amount\">\n                                ₱12k + tips\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] text-[#aea69c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"job salary period detail\">\n                                Contract · pay period not specified\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-3\" data-name=\"job location column\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[14px] text-[#dad2c1]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-3-1\" data-name=\"job zone label\">\n                                <i class=\"icon-map-pin text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-3-1-1\" data-name=\"map pin icon\">\n                                </i>\n                                Cogon\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] text-[#aea69c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-3-2\" data-name=\"job barangay detail\">\n                                Digos City\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-4\" data-name=\"job commute column\">\n                            <div class=\"text-[13px] text-[#aea69c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-4-1\" data-name=\"commute label heading\">\n                                Getting there\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#c9c0ad]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-4-2\" data-name=\"commute description text\">\n                                Own motorcycle required\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <i class=\"icon-arrow-up-right text-[18px] text-[#aea69c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-2-4-5\" data-name=\"job row navigation arrow icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n            <section class=\"mt-9 border-t border-[#3f3a36] pt-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4\" data-name=\"employer verification info section\">\n                <div class=\"flex max-w-[860px] items-start gap-3 text-[13px] leading-6 text-[#c9c0ad]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"info callout row\">\n                    <i class=\"icon-info text-[16px] text-[#f7f5f0]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"info icon\">\n                    </i>\n                    <p class=\"m-0\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"verification info paragraph\">\n                        <strong class=\"font-medium text-[#f7f5f0]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"verification info headline\">\n                            Employer verification.\n                        </strong>\n                        “Documents reviewed” means business documents were checked by the platform. Jobs without this note are still visible; review the employer details before applying.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n            <footer class=\"mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-[#3f3a36] pt-5 text-[12px] text-[#aea69c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-5\" data-name=\"site footer\">\n                <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"footer tagline text\">\n                    DigosJobs · Local openings for Digos City\n                </span>\n                <div class=\"flex gap-6\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-5-2\" data-name=\"footer links group\">\n                    <a class=\"text-[#c9c0ad] no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"view applications footer link\" href=\"#applications\" id=\"applications\">\n                        Already applied? View applications\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"text-[#c9c0ad] no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-5-2-2\" data-name=\"employer portal footer link\" href=\"#employers\" id=\"employers\">\n                        Posting a job? Employer portal\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </footer>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
